repository-code: "https://github.com/rkmaurya93049/Physics-Guided-Multi-Fidelity-Residual-Learning-for-Multi-Objective-Design-of-a-DC-DC-Buck-Converter"
abstract: >-
  Research repository supporting a simulation-level physics-guided multi-fidelity
  workflow for multi-objective design of a DC-DC buck converter using analytical
  modelling, automated LTspice simulations, residual machine learning, and NSGA-II.
keywords:
  - buck converter
  - multi-fidelity learning
  - residual learning
  - LTspice
  - NSGA-II
  - power electronics
  - surrogate modelling
